        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加“视频”标签页；需要 Apple silicon，通常还需 24 GB 以上的统一内存；在你选择模型之前不会下载或产生任何活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds tools and data from MCP servers you configure. Useful for tasks that need external context or actions; it does not improve the model itself and may add latency. Off by default—connector tools ask for approval unless you explicitly allow them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加你所配置的 MCP 服务器中的工具和数据。适合需要外部上下文或操作的任务；它不会提升模型本身，且可能增加延迟。默认关闭——除非你明确允许，否则连接器工具会请求批准。"
          }
