    "Folder name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文件夹名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For each first successful text chat reply, dictation, or generated image, only the milestone name and “Desktop” are sent. This version does not send a vision-reply milestone. The collector derives a country code but never stores your IP. Prompts, responses, attachments, and API keys are never collected. Change this anytime in Settings → Privacy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对于每次首次成功的文本聊天回复、听写或生成的图像，只会发送里程碑名称和“Desktop”。此版本不发送视觉回复里程碑。收集器会推导出国家/地区代码，但绝不存储你的 IP。提示词、回复、附件和 API 密钥绝不会被收集。你可以随时在“设置”→“隐私”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example `uvx` or `npx`. Rapid's engine only runs commands on its allowlist." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如 `uvx` 或 `npx`。Rapid 的引擎只会运行允许清单中的命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example: Answer concisely, use plain language, and include code examples when useful." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如：回答简洁，使用平实语言，并在有用时附上代码示例。"
