    "How fast is local AI on this Mac? Find out in minutes — then share your result to help build an open leaderboard of real models on real Macs, so everyone can pick the fastest local AI for their machine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 上的本地 AI 有多快？几分钟即可见分晓——然后分享你的结果，帮助构建一个真实模型在真实 Mac 上的开放排行榜，让每个人都能为自己的机器挑选最快的本地 AI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the model's attention cache is stored. Lower precision means less memory and faster long-context decoding." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
