    "Nothing is selected by default. Folders, hidden files, active downloads, and symbolic links are excluded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认不选中任何内容。文件夹、隐藏文件、正在下载的项目和符号链接会被排除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing you type\nleaves this Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你输入的内容\n都不会离开这台 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ON THIS MAC" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在这台 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OPTIONAL — MORE CAPABLE, USES MORE MEMORY" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可选 —— 能力更强，占用内存更多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Keeping recordings lets a correction be verified against the original audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。保留录音可让更正内容与原始音频进行核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, no description" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭，无描述"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Older" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更早"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On close, Rapid-MLX stays available from the menu bar. Turn off to keep the Dock icon visible; disabling takes effect immediately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时，Rapid-MLX 仍可从菜单栏使用。若要保留 Dock 图标，请关闭此项；禁用后立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On disk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On disk, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘上，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On launch, Rapid-MLX loads your last-used model into memory so the chat is interactive immediately. Nothing loads while first-run setup is still open. Turn off if you sometimes open Rapid-MLX just to browse past conversations — you can still start a model manually by picking one in the message box and sending." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动时，Rapid-MLX 会将你上次使用的模型加载到内存，让聊天立即可交互。首次运行设置仍打开时不会加载任何内容。如果你有时打开 Rapid-MLX 只是为了浏览过去的对话，可以关闭此项——你仍可在消息框中挑选模型并发送，以手动启动模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this Mac" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这台 Mac 上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On, with a description" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启，带描述"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On-device" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One %@ pull, once. After that this model starts in seconds and needs no network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只需拉取一次 %@。之后该模型几秒内即可启动，无需网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One OpenAI-compatible API spanning 48 frontier and open models. Rapid Macs add high-quality open-model capacity at the edge, with public pricing and live status." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个兼容 OpenAI 的 API，覆盖 48 个前沿与开源模型。Rapid Mac 在边缘增加高质量的开源模型算力，并公开定价和实时状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One download,\nthen it's yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次下载，\n从此归你所有。"
