    "Point Rapid at a folder where it already keeps downloaded models — for example on an external drive. New models download here; ones you already have stay where they are. Models downloaded by other apps in other formats won't appear here. New location takes effect the next time a model loads or downloads." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 Rapid 指向一个已存放下载模型的文件夹——例如外置驱动器上的文件夹。新模型会下载到这里；你已有的模型仍留在原处。其他应用以其他格式下载的模型不会出现在这里。新位置会在下次加载或下载模型时生效。"
