            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 找不到它的引擎。重新打开应用以再次运行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX checks the chip, the unified memory and the free space on the volume that holds your Hugging Face cache. Nothing is uploaded — the read is local." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 会检查芯片、统一内存，以及存放 Hugging Face 缓存的那个卷上的可用空间。不会上传任何内容——这次读取完全在本地完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX diagnostics" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 诊断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX is checking or downloading the update in the background." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 正在后台检查或下载更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX is local-first. Prompts, attachments, and model responses never leave your Mac. Anonymous usage data is sent only after you opt in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 以本地优先。提示词、附件和模型回复绝不会离开你的 Mac。匿名使用数据仅在你选择加入后才会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX is open source. If it helped today, a GitHub star helps other developers find it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 是开源的。如果它今天帮到了你，在 GitHub 上点颗星能帮助其他开发者发现它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX is reading the model catalogue to see which models are already on this Mac and how much each one would download. The short list below is fixed; only the “already downloaded” part depends on this read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rapid-MLX 正在读取模型目录，以确认哪些模型已在这台 Mac 上，以及每个模型需要下载多少。下面的候选清单是固定的；只有“已下载”这一部分取决于这次读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rapid-MLX isn't fully set up yet. Reopen Rapid-MLX to run the one-time setup again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
