    "Stops the download. The model will not be installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停止下载。该模型将不会被安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sub-1B models (qwen3-0.6b-*) are hidden from the model picker by default — they hallucinate within 1-2 turns and are intended for unit tests, not chat. Turn on to see every model, including the tiny ones." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小于 1B 的模型（qwen3-0.6b-*）默认从模型选择器中隐藏——它们会在 1-2 轮内产生幻觉，仅用于单元测试，不适合聊天。开启后可看到所有模型，包括最小的那些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sub-1B models are hidden by default — they hallucinate within 1-2 turns and are intended for unit tests, not chat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
