        }
      }
    },
    "The current key is stored in your Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前密钥存储在钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The difference is download size and how much memory the model holds while it runs, against this Mac's %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "区别在于下载大小，以及模型运行时占用的内存，对比这台 Mac 的 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The draft is too large for this preview (64 KB maximum)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "草稿过大，无法在此预览中显示（最大 64 KB）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time the model calls a connector tool, Rapid asks. Your answer is remembered per tool." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型首次调用连接器工具时，Rapid 会询问。你的回答会按工具分别记住。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The flow stopped because a local system operation failed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于本地系统操作失败，流程已停止。"
