        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "流程已停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The generated file will be removed from this Mac. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生成的文件将从这台 Mac 上移除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local engine isn't running. Restart it, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本地引擎未运行。请重启后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local model is warming up. Recording starts when it’s ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本地模型正在预热。就绪后即开始录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model could not be kept resident (HTTP %lld)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保持模型常驻（HTTP %lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model could not finish after %lld tool calls. Try rephrasing, or turn a tool off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型在 %lld 次工具调用后仍未能完成。请换个说法，或关闭某个工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model disconnected mid-reply. Restart it from the model bar at the top and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型在回复中途断开。请从顶部的模型栏重启后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model download didn't finish. Check your connection, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型下载未完成。请检查网络连接，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model server could not load another resident model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型服务器无法再加载一个常驻模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model server returned an invalid response." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型服务器返回了无效响应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model server returned invalid residency data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型服务器返回了无效的常驻数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model stopped responding (nothing for 10 minutes). It may be stuck — restart it from the model bar at the top, or try a shorter message." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型停止响应（已 10 分钟无任何输出）。它可能卡住了——请从顶部的模型栏重启，或尝试发送更短的消息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model wants to fetch content from:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型想要获取来自以下位置的内容："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model wants to run a tool from the “%@” connector." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型想要运行来自“%@”连接器的工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page's text is sent back to the model. Only http/https public addresses are allowed — private and local addresses are blocked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "页面文本会回传给模型。仅允许 http/https 公网地址——私有地址和本地地址会被阻止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queued request will be removed before generation begins." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "排队的请求将在生成开始前被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running model started before connectors were enabled, so it isn't loading them yet. Restarting takes a moment and keeps your conversation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在运行的模型在连接器启用前就已启动，因此尚未加载它们。重启只需片刻，并会保留你的对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved credential was malformed, so this model started with a one-time key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保存的凭证格式有误，因此此模型以一次性密钥启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved key couldn’t be removed from your Keychain. Retry cleanup before relying on Every start storage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法从你的钥匙串中移除已保存的密钥。在依赖“每次启动”存储之前，请先重试清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scan was stopped. No files were changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描已停止。没有文件被更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected TextEdit document has no readable draft." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选的 TextEdit 文稿没有可读取的草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected browser is no longer on the destination you reviewed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选浏览器已不在你审阅的目标页面上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file isn't a readable image." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选文件不是可读取的图像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected window is too complex for this preview flow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选窗口过于复杂，无法用于此预览流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The signed engine does not currently advertise a compatible video model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已签名的引擎当前未提供兼容的视频模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme, sampling, tool toggles, model favourites, window state — back to first-install defaults." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题、采样、工具开关、模型收藏、窗口状态——全部恢复为首次安装时的默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings change speed and memory use, and some can change what the model writes. They apply to one model at a time and take effect when that model next starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些设置会改变速度和内存占用，其中一些还会改变模型生成的内容。它们一次只对一个模型生效，并在该模型下次启动时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Keenable key has used its monthly credits. Check its plan, or clear the key in Settings → Tools to use keyless search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Keenable 密钥已用完本月额度。请检查其套餐，或在“设置”→“工具”中清除该密钥以使用无密钥搜索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Keenable key is rate-limited. Wait a moment, check its plan, or clear the key in Settings → Tools to use keyless search." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 Keenable 密钥受到速率限制。请稍等片刻，检查其套餐，或在“设置”→“工具”中清除该密钥以使用无密钥搜索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
