    },
    "Tool calls are unverified on this model — we have no bench signal yet. Chips that promise tools are hidden on the empty-state hero until verified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型的工具调用尚未验证——我们还没有基准测试信号。在验证通过前，空状态主视觉中承诺支持工具的标签会被隐藏。"
