        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools are off on this model — empirical bench shows it ignores tool calls and hallucinates the answer. Chips that promise tools are hidden on the empty-state hero." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型的工具功能已关闭——实测基准测试显示它会忽略工具调用并编造答案。空状态主视觉中承诺支持工具的标签已被隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tools the model can call during a chat. Turn one off and it is never offered — and never runs, even if the model asks for it by name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型在聊天中可调用的工具。关闭某个工具后，它就不会再被提供，也绝不会运行，即使模型点名请求它。"
