    "Welcome" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "欢迎"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the connected servers expose. Turn one off and it is never offered to the model — and never runs, even if the model asks for it by name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已连接的服务器所开放的能力。关闭某一项后，它就绝不会再提供给模型，也绝不会运行，即使模型点名请求它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would you like Rapid to draft?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你想让 Rapid 起草什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, model switches may interrupt active API or streaming requests without asking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，切换模型可能会在未询问的情况下中断正在进行的 API 或流式请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, opening Rapid-MLX will not load a model until you start one manually from the picker." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，打开 Rapid-MLX 不会加载任何模型，直到你从选取器中手动启动一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the model is running, the API key and integration commands below fill in and their Copy buttons wake up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模型运行后，下方的 API 密钥和集成命令会填入内容，其“拷贝”按钮也会变为可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the data goes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数据流向"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which backend `web_search` queries. Keenable works with no account; add a free key (Parallel recommended) for the best results. Keys stay in your Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`web_search` 查询所使用的后端。Keenable 无需账户即可使用；添加免费密钥（推荐 Parallel）可获得最佳结果。密钥保存在你的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
