    "image_input.unavailable.generic_text_lane" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model is running text-only. Photos need a vision-capable model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型当前只能处理文字。要添加照片，请选择支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.legacy_model" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model doesn't support photos. Choose a vision-capable model to add one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型不支持照片。要添加照片，请选择支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.speculative_decode" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model is running text-only because speculative decoding is on. Turn it off in Settings → Performance to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于已开启推测解码，此模型当前只能处理文字。请在设置中的“性能”里将其关闭，然后再添加照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.text_checkpoint" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model doesn't support photos. Choose a vision-capable model to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型不支持照片。要添加照片，请选择支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.text_lane_forced" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model runs text-only; its vision path isn't available. Choose a vision-capable model to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型当前只能处理文字，视觉功能不可用。要添加照片，请选择支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.vision_features_unavailable" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model is running text-only because its vision features aren't available. Choose a different vision-capable model to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型当前只能处理文字，因为其视觉功能不可用。要添加照片，请选择另一个支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.vision_memory_insufficient" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Text chat is ready with this model. Photo mode needs more memory than this Mac has. Choose a vision model with lower memory requirements to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此模型的文字聊天可以正常使用。照片模式需要的内存超过这台 Mac 的容量；如需添加照片，请选择内存需求更低的视觉模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "image_input.unavailable.vision_runtime_unsupported" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This model is running text-only because its vision runtime isn't supported here. Choose a different vision-capable model to add photos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于这台 Mac 不支持此模型的视觉运行环境，它当前只能处理文字。要添加照片，请选择另一个支持视觉的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS did not allow Rapid to read Downloads. Review Files & Folders access in System Settings, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 Rapid 读取“下载”文件夹。请在系统设置中检查“文件与文件夹”访问权限，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keeps about a fifth of unified memory for itself, so a %@ Mac has roughly %@ to give a model. Rapid keeps some of that free for your conversation, so it offers models needing up to about %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS keeps about a fifth of unified memory for itself, so a %1$@ Mac has roughly %2$@ to give a model. Rapid keeps some of that free for your conversation, so it offers models needing up to about %3$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 会为自己保留约五分之一的统一内存，因此一台 %@ Mac 大约有 %@ 可以分配给模型。Rapid 会从中留出一部分供你的对话使用，因此它提供的模型最多约需 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS says the network is off, but Rapid runs entirely on your Mac, so this usually doesn't matter. Restart the model from the model bar at the top; if that fails, restart your Mac." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 提示网络已关闭，但 Rapid 完全在你的 Mac 上运行，所以这通常无关紧要。请从顶部的模型栏重启模型；如果仍然失败，请重启你的 Mac。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "memory: —" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内存：—"
          }
        }
